{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/569937-beast-stereotypes","id":569937,"title":"Beast Stereotypes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-06-26T21:53:12-07:00","id":569937,"title":"Beast Stereotypes","content":"I'm surprised that the Beast kickstarter doesn't have stereotypes for Hunters. We already know that Hunters aren't Hero and vice a versa, even though the two groups can and sometimes do work together. I believe that the text said that Hunters and Heroes are like opposite ends of the spectrum. So I thought that I'd they to make a few of my own. Tell me what you think:<br /> <br /> Anakim: Big man, throwing his weight around, enforcing his laws. You're not a hunter, your target practice!<br /> <br /> Eshmaki: A Light in the darkness, huh? Good. More shadows for me to hide in.<br /> <br /> Makara: You're in over your head, don't make me pull you under.<br /> <br /> Namtaru: You think you've seen the dark and ugly side of the world? Let me show you a real monster!<br /> <br /> Ugallu: I can still see you.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3857-kingme1","name":"Kingme1","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-26T22:05:12-07:00","id":569959,"title":"","content":"I think it's because hunters have too much variance in who they are. A few may be Heroes lite, but VASCU wouldn't mind Dante if they were all like that. Or even mostly like that.<br /> <br /> Feels like they should have friendly stereotypes too:<br /> <br /> Anakim: You got guts, coming up against me. Give me a reason to spare you, and I'll take it.<br /> <br /> Eshmaki: Welcome to my home, little candles. Enjoy your stay-unless you try to burn me, of course.<br /> <br /> Makara: Careful-knowledge is like water, water drowns flame. I'm not even trying to threaten you.<br /> <br /> Namtaru: You don't judge a book<i> \u200bentirely</i> by cover, at least. I respect that.<br /> <br /> Ugallu: Gaze unto the abyss, and the abyss gazes unto you. And I could look all day.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-26T22:34:46-07:00","id":569969,"title":"","content":"All of them: God damnit, I just put the lightbulb back in!<br /> <br /> Sorry,that's referencing an obscenely old thread.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-27T01:49:32-07:00","id":570035,"title":"","content":"Oh here I thought this was going to be about hunter thoughts on beasts, not vice versa.<br /> <br /> Keep in mind that hunters are the one gameline beasts will likely have the least info on- As it stand the lucifuge and the otodo are the only conspiracies that count as kin, and without inside information, why would the beasts see such disparate groups as FBI psychics, religious cannibals, bloodmagic using terrorists, and tattooed bounty hunters as a singular thing?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-06-27T02:13:46-07:00","id":570077,"title":"","content":"Anakim: There's nothing more dangerous than hope.<br /> <br /> Eshmaki: Teach me.<br /> <br /> Makara: We've both left the shallow side of the pool.<br /> <br /> Namtaru: Carry a torch. But careful where you point it.<br /> <br /> Ugallu: You're right! Let's expose them _all_!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault